+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: APSL-2.0 */
+/*
+ * MONDRIAN VENUS V1: PAS 9 load and polled HFI system-property proof.
+ *
+ * Goal: load vpu20_4v through PAS 9, bring up IRIS2, and observe an HFI
+ * HFI_PROP_IMAGE_VERSION response. No session, encode, decode, camera,
+ * VideoToolbox registration, user client or IRQ is implemented.
+ *
+ * Architecture and safety rules:
+ *   - DenialOfGravity/ios-redfin, MIT (PIL/queue/SMMU bring-up architecture).
+ *   - akshaynexus/iOSPlus10 0255/0297, MIT (guarded MMIO concept).
+ *   - ios-mondrian patches 0417/0418, APSL-2.0 (guarded access and SMMU shape).
+ *
+ * Hardware/protocol facts only, no GPL/vendor source copied:
+ *   - dtb/mondrian-live.dtb.
+ *   - Linux v6.18 videocc-sm8450.c, gcc-sm8450.c, clk-alpha-pll.c,
+ *     arm-smmu.h, arm-smmu-qcom.c and qcom_scm.c.
+ *   - Qualcomm SM8475 vendor video driver at
+ *     HELLBOY017/kernel_nothing_sm8475@1e9dd6b500785e043314bc71bcb4255d418fd68c:
+ *       techpack/video/driver/variant/iris2/src/msm_vidc_iris2.c
+ *       techpack/video/driver/vidc/src/venus_hfi.c
+ *       techpack/video/driver/vidc/src/hfi_packet.c
+ *       techpack/video/driver/vidc/src/venus_hfi_response.c
+ *       techpack/video/driver/vidc/inc/{hfi_command.h,hfi_property.h,
+ *                                      msm_vidc_internal.h}
+ *
+ * The firmware provider reads /private/var/vm/vpu20_4v.mbn. The blob is
+ * extracted from the exact stock vendor_a image and is never committed.
+ * Wi-Fi W2 and Venus must not be enabled together until bank claiming is
+ * serialized.
+ */
